14
00:02:58,750 --> 00:03:12,450
Before the loop or recursion begins, show why it is true. For every update, explain why it remains

15
00:03:12,500 --> 00:03:26,200
true. At termination, connect it directly to the returned answer. This structure turns code narration into a short

16
00:03:26,250 --> 00:03:39,950
correctness proof. It also exposes common bugs early: if a variable cannot be connected to the invariant, it

17
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:53,700
