25
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:43,700
at least one normal transition, one boundary transition, and one transition that changes the best answer. Do not

26
00:05:43,750 --> 00:05:57,450
narrate every assignment. Narrate the decisions that rule out alternatives. In a live interview, a small table with

27
00:05:57,500 --> 00:06:11,200
input position, active state, and current answer is usually enough to make the reasoning visible. The target analysis

28
