35
00:07:47,500 --> 00:08:01,200
first or last position, and the smallest input that forces the main state transition. For numeric problems, add

36
00:08:01,250 --> 00:08:14,950
zero, negative values, and overflow-sized totals when the prompt permits them. A good

37
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:28,700
